  "english": "...on all the earth. [Book of] Wisdom 9:12. \"And my works shall be acceptable...\" to chapter 10:2, \"...having power over all things.\" Prophet Jeremiah 16:16. \"Thus says the Lord...\" to verse 19, \"...in the day of evil.\" Acts 8:26. \"An angel of the Lord...\" to verse 40, \"...to Caesarea.\" Alleluia. \"You shall make them princes...\" Gospel John 1:35. \"The next day...\" to verse 51, \"...of the Son of Man.\" In the Evening: \"Joyful Light\" [Phos Hilaron]. Evening Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 1 [ah]: \"You are holy, O Lord,\" and \"From You we ask...\"\n\nTenth Sunday after the Holy Cross. Canticle of the Fathers Tone 1 [ah]: \"Who came for salvation.\" Midday Psalm 64 [65]: \"To You praise is due...\" Prophet Isaiah 25:9. \"And they shall say on that day...\" to chapter 26:7, \"...of the godly.\" Apostle Philippians 1:1. \"Paul and Timothy...\" to verse 11, \"...to the praise of God.\" Alleluia of the Resurrection in the proper tone. Gospel Luke 9:44. \"And while they marveled...\" to verse 50, \"...is on your side.\"\n\nKnow, O lover of feasts, that if the period of eating meat is seven weeks, this Tenth Sunday is always the Eve [Barikendan] of the Advent Fast. But if it is eight weeks, here add one week with its feasts, on the Saturday of which is performed the Feast of All Saints, both old and new, and the Sunday placed below is called the Eleventh Sunday, and the Eve of the Advent Fast; all this the Directory [Taregirk] will show you.\n\nSaturday. Feast of All Saints, ancient and modern, known and unknown. Canticle Tone 3 [ga]: \"Blessed holy apostles.\" Canticle of the Fathers Tone 8 [dk]: \"To You, O God.\" Magnificat Tone 8 [dk]: \"[Of the] Patriarchs.\" Miserere [Oghormya] of the Prophets Tone 7 [dza]: \"Who by your good news...\" Praise the Lord from the Heavens [Ter yerknits] of the Doctors Tone 7 [dza]: \"Today the heavenly hosts with us...\" Midday Hymn [Mankunk] of the Virgins Tone 8 [dk]: \"Memory of Christ,\" and \"We who have come...\" Midday Introit: \"Through the intercession...\" Hymn Tone 4 [by]: \"Boast of the Church,\" and \"God our Savior.\" Psalm 14 [15]: \"Those who fear the Lord...\" Proverbs [Book of Wisdom] 3:1. \"But the souls of the righteous...\" to verse 8, \"...forever.\" Prophet Isaiah 33:5. \"Holy is the Lord...\" to verse 8 [6?], \"...them among men.\" Apostle Hebrews 11:32. \"And what more shall I say...\" to chapter 12:2, \"...of the throne of God.\" Alleluia. \"The saints shall boast...\" Gospel Luke 12:4. \"But I say to you...\" to verse 9, \"...of God.\"",
